            "review_title": "Review at Chay May Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Marzieh P\n6 contributions\n0\nDelicious vegetarian food!\nOct 2017 • Couples\nMy partner and I had a delicious meal at May vegetarian restaurant. We ordered a vegetable and noodle soup, wok stir-fries vegetables and rice noodles, spring rolls and a mango drink.\nAll were delicious, healthy, meat-free meals. The food didn't taste oily and we left satisfied. It was reasonably priced too.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 17, 2017",
